   "date": "2015-07-21",
   "text": "Protect Local Independence in Housing Act of 2015\n Amends the Fair Housing Act to prohibit its provisions from being construed to prohibit conduct resulting in a disparate impact on a class protected by such Act unless the person engaging in that conduct intended that impact."
